    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Paper Arcade: Pong \u00a0</strong>is a hand-drawn, chaotic spin on the classic arcade formula, set entirely on a piece of notebook paper. With charming pencil-sketch aesthetics, the game combines the familiar gameplay of pong with a sporty twist inspired by soccer. Power-ups like multiball and magnets add unpredictable variety, turning simple volleys into wild, physics-bending rallies. While built for 2-player core gameplay, <strong>Paper Pong</strong> supports up to 8 total paddles by filling the arena with AI-controlled opponents or teammates, letting you dive into solo duels, team matches, or all-out free-for-alls. It\u2019s fast, fun, and full of scrappy, sketchbook personality.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Paper Arcade: Pong \u00a0</strong>is a hand-drawn, chaotic spin on the classic arcade formula, set entirely on a piece of notebook paper. With charming pencil-sketch aesthetics, the game combines the familiar gameplay of pong with a sporty twist inspired by soccer. Power-ups like multiball and magnets add unpredictable variety, turning simple volleys into wild, physics-bending rallies. While built for 2-player core gameplay, <strong>Paper Pong</strong> supports up to 8 total paddles by filling the arena with AI-controlled opponents or teammates, letting you dive into solo duels, team matches, or all-out free-for-alls. It\u2019s fast, fun, and full of scrappy, sketchbook personality.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Paper Arcade: Pong is a hand-drawn twist on the arcade classic! With soccer-inspired visuals, magnetic chaos, and multiball power-ups, it's pong like you've never seen. Play 1v1 or add up to 6 AI players for frantic free-for-alls and sketchy team battles.",
